          <attvalue for="35" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Escalating regional military tensions trigger global risk‑off flows into safe‑haven reserve currency assets, mechanically lifting a major currency's trade‑weighted index as capital reweights toward that currency." />
