          <attvalue for="29" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Heightened Middle East military tensions force NATO and EU members to reallocate forces, intelligence and political attention to the region and produce competing national priorities, eroding policy alignment and burden‑sharing cohesion for collective action on the Russia–Ukraine war." />
