          <attvalue for="35" value="0.65" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Escalating military threats in the Middle East produce divergent threat assessments and preferred responses among transatlantic partners, generating disputes over burden-sharing, basing, and use-of-force that reduce coalition cohesion." />
