          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Higher policy rates in major economies raise sovereign and corporate financing costs for regional governments and external patrons, forcing fiscal retrenchment that reduces security cooperation and proxy funding and thereby incentivizes rivals to test red lines or prompt proxy escalations." />
          <attvalue for="37" value="6-18 months" />
